<attribute name="mainDescription" nodeId="55d8021a">&lt;p&gt;
    Review user feedback collected from the software demonstration. Categorize feedback according to the software object
    type, e.g. report, interface, conversion, etc. Additionally, determine if feedback is truly a defect, i.e. an error,
    flaw, failure, or fault in the package application, or if the feedback is out of scope and should be part of a new
    requirement.
&lt;/p&gt;</attribute>
<attribute name="externalId" nodeId="3ee25dbd"></attribute>
<attribute name="keyConsiderations" nodeId="b9d22347">Distinguish between true defects and new requirements, i.e. if it should be considered out of scope for this release.</attribute>
<attribute name="longPresentationName" nodeId="8708d620"></attribute>
<attribute name="purpose" nodeId="ffe17693">To make a recommendation on the user feedback received.</attribute>
<attribute name="alternatives" nodeId="1b2a1ac8"></attribute>
</Element>
